`comment("
Detection:   Repeated Failed Windows Logons - 3 in 5 Minutes
Data source: WinEventLog:Security (Event ID 4625 - failed logon)
Logic:       3+ failed logons for the same user inside a 5-minute bucket
Schedule:    cron */5 * * * *  |  Search window: last 15 minutes
Trigger:     Number of results > 0  |  Action: Add to Triggered Alerts
Tuning:      Throttle - suppress by target_user for 15 minutes
MITRE ATT&CK: T1110 - Brute Force
")`
index=* host="DESKTOP-4AMTH10" sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| eval target_user=mvindex(Account_Name,-1)
| where isnotnull(target_user) AND target_user!="" AND NOT match(target_user,"\$$")
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count as failed_logons
        values(Source_Network_Address) as source
        values(Workstation_Name) as workstation
        by _time target_user
| where failed_logons>=3
